WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs in a wide V.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Walk the hands forward and fold softly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the knees and toes pointing up.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the forehead on a block if needed.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise slowly.
